🟠 [coupon-clamp-min-one] MUST-FIX src/coupon.js:4 clamps pct with Math.max(1, pct), giving range 1..100 instead of the contract's 0..100; concrete failure: couponCents(10000, 0) returns 100 instead of 0, so a 0% coupon still discounts 1% and checkoutTotal(subtotal, 0, rateBp, weightG) understates the total by subtotal/100 via src/checkout.js:6; smallest remediation: change Math.max(1, pct) to Math.max(0, pct).
🟠 [ship-zero-weight-charged] MUST-FIX src/ship.js:4 returns 500 for weightG = 0 (the guard is weightG < 0, so 0 falls through to 500 + Math.ceil(0/500) * 100 at src/ship.js:6), but the contract requires shippingCents(0) = 0; concrete failure: shippingCents(0) = 500, adding a phantom 500 cents to every weight-0 checkoutTotal via src/checkout.js:7; smallest remediation: change the guard to if (weightG <= 0) return 0;.
